  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the role of youth in promoting increased mutual understa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of project is to empower Young people to enhance dialogue and trust across the region by promoting fact-based, positive narratives and gender equality in the public sphere and media.

The role of culture in advancing peace building and reconciliation is extremely important as promote importance of cultural diversity and advance processes of mutual comprehension and respect. The combination of Culture and Education as well as strong involvement of Youth will enable a more open dialogue, not necessarily burdened with events of the recent past and historical development of the region, and thus directly contribute to the stabilisation processes.</narrative>
  </description>
